                "original_url": "https://alarmingdevelopment.org/?p=1716",
                "fallback": "Alarming Development: Operational Version Control",
                "text": "Abstract of a talk I just gave: It would be useful to have version control like git but for data structures, particularly the data structures we call spreadsheets, databases, and ASTs. Operational \u2026",
                "title": "Operational Version Control",
                "title_link": "https://alarmingdevelopment.org/?p=1716",
                "service_name": "Alarming Development"
